{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01467","headline":"相和歌辞 阳春曲 · 庄南杰","name":"相和歌辞 阳春曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫锦红囊香满风，金鸾玉轼摇丁冬。\n沙鸥白羽翦晴碧，野桃红艳烧春空。\n芳草绵延锁平地，壠蝶双双舞幽翠。\n凤叫龙吟白日长，落花声底仙娥醉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庄南杰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01467.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01467","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}